# CONFIG's Basic Tuning for a rover, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigArdurover.cs.
#
# SoftwareConfig adds ConfigArdurover as "Basic Tuning", and opens on it, only when the vehicle is
# an ArduRover (SoftwareConfig.cs:186-189); a copter's Basic Tuning is ConfigSimplePids
# (:160-165). The SITL these scripts run against is a copter - tools/sitl carries no rover - so the
# page cannot be opened here: the claim this script checks is the list's condition - with every
# parameter in, CONFIG opens on the copter's Basic Tuning, and ConfigArdurover is neither listed
# nor shown.
#
# The page itself is proved against a scripted rover by the unit tests in
# crates/mp-gui/src/config/rover_tuning.rs: every Designer control at its .resx place (Refresh
# Params invisible), Activate's 25 numbers and six combos bound to the first name the vehicle has,
# Avoidance hidden without a sonar trigger, the tooltips, each control's own write - a combo at
# once, a number 300 ms after it changes - Write Params and Ctrl+S writing nothing (no control
# fills `changes`), and Refresh Screen activating the page again.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-rover-tuning.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" boxes this script clicks are not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
settle 6
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

# CONFIG lists the tuning pages once every parameter is in (SoftwareConfig.cs:148-150), and here
# parameters are downloaded when asked for.
click param-download
settle 15
expect params.held > 1000

click tab-config
settle 1
expect screen config
expect config.page ConfigSimplePids
expect config.title Basic Tuning
expect config.rover.listed false
expect config.rover.active false
